{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111080647105-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111085326\"/><p>事主今早被發現在海面載浮載沉。(馬竟峯攝)</p><p>西環有人墮海。今晨(11日)7時39分，執法部門接報指，一名南亞裔男子被發現在中西區海濱長廊近2及3號碼頭對開海面載浮載沉。救援人員接報到場，救起昏迷事主，交由救護車送往瑪麗醫院搶救，男子身份及墮海原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:09:50.957747+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:06:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T02:04:08.564430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:03:23.550853+00:00","content_hash":"54e81edde4c54d547dd3857f6289325a9b12bc04b1a20a8d04ecf7e9fb221054","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}